    "text": "<p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mtext>&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;</mtext><munderover><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></munderover><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><munderover><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></munderover><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></msubsup><mo>&#8805;</mo><msubsup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>5</mn></mfenced><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>5</mn></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>11</mn></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ....<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>&#39;</mo><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><munderover><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></munderover><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>&#39;</mo><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><munderover><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></munderover><mn>4</mn><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></msubsup><mo>&#8805;</mo><msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></msub